{"seq":2,"slug":"model-based-cf","title":"基于模型的协同过滤","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-recommendation-systems/collaborative-filtering/model-based-cf","wordCount":959,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"基于模型的协同过滤\">基于模型的协同过滤</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>基于模型的协同过滤（Model-based Collaborative Filtering）通过训练参数化模型来学习用户-物品交互中的潜在模式，然后用模型预测未知的评分。与基于记忆的方法直接使用原始评分矩阵不同，基于模型的方法先从数据中「学习」一个压缩的表示，再用这个表示进行推荐。主流方法包括潜在因子模型（如 SVD、NMF）、聚类方法、贝叶斯方法和关联规则。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[用户-物品评分矩阵] --&gt; B[模型训练]&#10;    B --&gt; C[潜在因子模型]&#10;    B --&gt; D[聚类模型]&#10;    B --&gt; E[概率模型]&#10;    C --&gt; F[用户/物品隐向量]&#10;    D --&gt; G[用户/物品簇]&#10;    E --&gt; H[概率分布参数]&#10;    F --&gt; I[评分预测]&#10;    G --&gt; I&#10;    H --&gt; I\">graph TD\n    A[用户-物品评分矩阵] --&gt; B[模型训练]\n    B --&gt; C[潜在因子模型]\n    B --&gt; D[聚类模型]\n    B --&gt; E[概率模型]\n    C --&gt; F[用户/物品隐向量]\n    D --&gt; G[用户/物品簇]\n    E --&gt; H[概率分布参数]\n    F --&gt; I[评分预测]\n    G --&gt; I\n    H --&gt; I</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型类型</th>\n<th>代表方法</th>\n<th>核心思想</th>\n<th>计算复杂度</th>\n<th>可扩展性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>潜在因子</td>\n<td>SVD、ALS</td>\n<td>矩阵分解为低秩近似</td>\n<td>O(k·nnz)</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>聚类</td>\n<td>K-Means CF</td>\n<td>用户/物品聚类后组内推荐</td>\n<td>O(n·k·t)</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>概率</td>\n<td>pLSA、LDA</td>\n<td>概率生成模型</td>\n<td>O(n·k·t)</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>受限玻尔兹曼机</td>\n<td>RBM-CF</td>\n<td>能量模型学习分布</td>\n<td>O(n·h·t)</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"svd-与-funk-svd\">SVD 与 Funk-SVD</h2><p>传统 SVD（Singular Value Decomposition）将评分矩阵 R 分解为三个矩阵的乘积 R = UΣV^T，但评分矩阵的稀疏性使得标准 SVD 无法直接应用（缺失值怎么处理？）。Simon Funk 在 2006 年 Netflix Prize 比赛中提出了 Funk-SVD：只对已知评分进行矩阵分解，通过 SGD 优化目标函数 <code>min Σ (r_ui - p_u^T · q_i)²  + λ(||p_u||² + ||q_i||²)</code>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface FunkSVDConfig {&#10;  readonly factors: number;&#10;  readonly learningRate: number;&#10;  readonly regularization: number;&#10;  readonly epochs: number;&#10;  readonly minImprovement: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface LatentFactors {&#10;  readonly userFactors: Float32Array[];&#10;  readonly itemFactors: Float32Array[];&#10;  readonly userBias: Float32Array;&#10;  readonly itemBias: Float32Array;&#10;  readonly globalBias: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface Rating {&#10;  readonly userId: number;&#10;  readonly itemId: number;&#10;  readonly value: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function trainFunkSVD(&#10;  ratings: ReadonlyArray&lt;Rating&gt;,&#10;  numUsers: number,&#10;  numItems: number,&#10;  config: FunkSVDConfig,&#10;): LatentFactors {&#10;  const userFactors = initRandomFactors(numUsers, config.factors);&#10;  const itemFactors = initRandomFactors(numItems, config.factors);&#10;  const userBias = new Float32Array(numUsers);&#10;  const itemBias = new Float32Array(numItems);&#10;  const globalBias = ratings.reduce((s, r) =&gt; s + r.value, 0) / ratings.length;&#10;&#10;  for (let epoch = 0; epoch &lt; config.epochs; epoch++) {&#10;    for (const rating of ratings) {&#10;      const predicted = predictSVD(&#10;        userFactors[rating.userId],&#10;        itemFactors[rating.itemId],&#10;        userBias[rating.userId],&#10;        itemBias[rating.itemId],&#10;        globalBias,&#10;      );&#10;      const error = rating.value - predicted;&#10;&#10;      userBias[rating.userId] += config.learningRate * (error - config.regularization * userBias[rating.userId]);&#10;      itemBias[rating.itemId] += config.learningRate * (error - config.regularization * itemBias[rating.itemId]);&#10;&#10;      for (let f = 0; f &lt; config.factors; f++) {&#10;        const pu = userFactors[rating.userId][f];&#10;        const qi = itemFactors[rating.itemId][f];&#10;        userFactors[rating.userId][f] += config.learningRate * (error * qi - config.regularization * pu);&#10;        itemFactors[rating.itemId][f] += config.learningRate * (error * pu - config.regularization * qi);&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return { userFactors, itemFactors, userBias, itemBias, globalBias };&#10;}&#10;&#10;function predictSVD(&#10;  userFactor: Float32Array,&#10;  itemFactor: Float32Array,&#10;  userBias: number,&#10;  itemBias: number,&#10;  globalBias: number,&#10;): number {&#10;  let dot = 0;&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; userFactor.length; i++) {&#10;    dot += userFactor[i] * itemFactor[i];&#10;  }&#10;  return globalBias + userBias + itemBias + dot;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function initRandomFactors(count: number, dim: number): Float32Array[] {&#10;  return Array.from({ length: count }, () =&gt; {&#10;    const factors = new Float32Array(dim);&#10;    for (let i = 0; i &lt; dim; i++) {&#10;      factors[i] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.01;&#10;    }&#10;    return factors;&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FunkSVDConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> factors</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> learningRate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#